{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/collections/essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock-local-government-reorganisation","content_id":"8aa4aa4b-ef2a-463b-b227-7473fec39520","description":"Documents relating to the government’s programme of local government reorganisation in Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock.","details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h2 id=\"timeline\">Timeline</h2>\n\n<h4 id=\"february-2025\">5 February 2025</h4>\n\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-invitation-to-local-authorities-in-two-tier-areas/letter-essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock\">invitation letter</a> sent to councils in ​Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock set out their milestones for reorganisation.</p>\n\n<p>They were invited to submit final proposals for unitary local government by 26 September 2025.</p>\n\n<h4 id=\"november-2025\">19 November 2025</h4>\n\n<p>A <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://questions-statements.parliament.uk/written-statements/detail/2025-11-19/hcws1071\">written ministerial statement</a> was made to Parliament. This set out that a <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock\">statutory consultation on proposals for local government reorganisation in Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock</a> was published.</p>\n\n<p>The Minister of State for Local Government and Homelessness also wrote to the leaders of councils in Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock to thank them for their proposals and inform them of the consultation.</p>\n\n<h4 id=\"march-2026\">25 March 2026</h4>\n\n<p>A <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://questions-statements.parliament.uk/written-statements/detail/2026-03-25/hcws1455\">written ministerial statement</a> was made to Parliament, setting out the Secretary of State’s decision to implement the proposal for 5 unitary councils to be established in Essex.</p>\n\n<p>Secondary legislation, which will be subject to Parliamentary approval, will now be taken forward to abolish existing councils, establish new councils and make transitional arrangements. </p>\n\n<p>​Accompanying this announcement, letters were sent to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-decision-letter-to-essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock-council-leaders\">Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock council leaders</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 id=\"september-2026\">7 September 2026</h4>\n\n<p>On 7 September 2026, the Minister for Local Government, Devolution and Regional Growth wrote to local government reorganisation council leaders.</p>\n\n<p>This letter announced the withdrawal of the current decisions for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock</li>\n  <li>Hampshire, Isle of Wight, Portsmouth and Southampton</li>\n  <li>Norfolk</li>\n  <li>Suffolk</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>It also announced a rapid review of the local government reorganisation programme. This includes decisions taken in July 2026 and the 2 outstanding areas awaiting decisions.</p>\n\n<p>The Secretary of State also announced these measures in an oral statement to Parliament on 7 September 2026.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Review update letter to council leaders added.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:01:16Z"},{"note":"Programme review and decisions withdrawal letter to council leaders added.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-07T16:03:14Z"},{"note":"Letter to Thurrock commissioners added.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-29T15:28:05Z"},{"note":"Implementation letter to Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock council chief executives added.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:48:46Z"},{"note":"Decision letter to Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock council leaders added.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-25T13:12:51Z"},{"note":"Letter to council leaders on publicity code added.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-19T16:29:06Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-19T00:00:00Z"}],"collection_groups":[{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n</div>","documents":["7e0b27fb-356b-4861-82b2-f393f39b8141"],"title":"Consultations"},{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\">\n</div>","documents":["2d4c8dae-f904-4f01-b20b-5b49dfc9b238","c504c71b-3378-462f-8f9d-a9fc8b5fe09b","ffa21d1a-45b5-4b62-a8ce-51fc3699ff7f","78d9f545-971f-485f-8dfd-68d1b6862b14","6b0906db-3a77-492c-98c4-eba50a5dec17","102dadca-ef63-4705-af8e-fbe5f3f45f63","4c76d086-d39a-4d4c-a4d2-04e4a30bbfa0"],"title":"Letters to Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock councils"}],"emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"first_public_at":"2025-11-19T00:00:00.000+00:00","headers":[{"id":"timeline","level":2,"text":"Timeline"}],"political":false},"document_type":"document_collection","first_published_at":"2025-11-19T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock-local-government-reorganisation","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/collections/essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock-local-government-reorganisation","base_path":"/government/collections/essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock-local-government-reorganisation","content_id":"8aa4aa4b-ef2a-463b-b227-7473fec39520","document_type":"document_collection","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-10-29T17:01:16Z","schema_name":"document_collection","title":"Essex, Southend-on-Sea and Thurrock: Local government reorganisation","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/essex-southend-on-sea-and-thurrock-local-government-reorganisation","withdrawn":false}],"document_collections":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/local-government-reorganisation-policy-and-programme-updates","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/collections/local-government-reorganisation-policy-and-programme-updates","base_path":"/government/collections/local-government-reorganisation-policy-and-programme-upda